e":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1043","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[80,87,36,12,87,78],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"255","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP22002","armor":"WP1001302","helmet":"WP1013902"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1042","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[80,87,36,12,87,78],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"255","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP22002","armor":"WP1001302","helmet":"WP1013902"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1043","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[80,87,36,12,87,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP22002","armor":"WP1001302","helmet":"WP1013902"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10210","city":"CS1042","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[80,87,36,12,87,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP22002","armor":"WP1001302","helmet":"WP1013902"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1004908","name":{"zh":"花鬘完婚","en":"Hua Man's Wedding"},"year":"999","month":"999","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"孟获与祝融夫人之女，出自古典戏曲《龙凤巾》。形象与祝融相近，善于前线作战的女战士，艺高强、性格刚烈。戏曲中诸葛亮平定南蛮期间，花鬘曾与关索交战，失败被俘后二人人互生爱意，孟获一众彻底降于诸葛亮后便与成婚，成为关索妻子之一。","tc":"孟獲與祝融夫人之女，出自古典戲曲《龍鳳巾》。形象與祝融相近，善于前線作戰的女戰士，藝高強、性格剛烈。戲曲中諸葛亮平定南蠻期間，花鬘曾與關索交戰，失敗被俘后二人人互生愛意，孟獲一眾徹底降于諸葛亮后便與成婚，成為關索妻子之一。","en":"Daughter of Meng Huo and Lady Zhurong, originating from the classical opera ‘The Dragon and Phoenix Scarf’. Similar in appearance to Zhurong, she was a fierce female warrior skilled in frontline combat, formidable in martial arts and fiery in temperament. In the opera, during Zhuge Liang's pacification of the Nanman, Hua Man clashed with Guan Suo in battle. After her defeat and capture, the two fell in love. Following Meng Huo's final surrender to Zhuge Liang, she married Guan Suo, becoming one of his wives.","jp":"孟獲と祝融夫人の娘。古典戯曲『竜鳳巾』に登場する人物。母の祝融に似て前線での戦いを得意とする女戦士であり、武芸に秀で、剛烈な性格をしていた。戯曲では諸葛亮が南蛮を平定する際、関索と戦って敗れ捕虜となるが、互いに好意を抱くようになる。孟獲らが諸葛亮に完全に降伏した後に関索と婚礼を挙げ、その妻のひとりとなった。","kr":"맹획과 축융부인의 딸로, 고전 희곡 《용봉건》에 등장한다. 축융과 풍모가 비슷한 여전사로, 전방 전투에 능하고 무예가 뛰어나며 성격이 강렬하다. 희곡에서 제갈량이 남만을 평정할 당시 화만은 관색과 맞서 싸우다 패하여 사로잡혔는데, 두 사람은 서로 연정을 품게 되었다. 이후 맹획 일행이 제갈량에게 완전히 항복하자 관색과 혼인하여 부인 중 한 명이 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10231","remark":"","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"花鬘","nameTc":"花鬘","nameEn":"Huaman","nameJp":"花鬘","nameKr":"화만","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"花鬘","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"223","city":"CS1043","gender":"1","rule":"80","force":"87","wise":"36","politics":"12","charm":"87","will":"78","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"2","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"39/82/39/39/39/12/69/39","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1002900;1005400","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1002605;S1000805","battleSoul":"1008805","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"8000","battleSoulPoint":"7000","debateSoulPoint":"1000","strategy":"1007215","strategy2":"1008501","professions":"3/3/1/0/0/0/2/0/0/0/2/1/1/4/1/3/0/1/0/0/2/2/5/5","attribute2":"82/91/39/14/87/81","morality":"7","compatible":"40","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","titl